      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カティナ",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "討伐と同時にこの魔法石を設置すれば、\n霊脈を沈静化させられるからお願いね。\nあ、霊脈への地図も用意してあるから参考にして。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カティナ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "311252bfa8d4905a36d5deb1fa042ba82c2700cfea0e9a7d6b1c183ea84e2b1a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あと、道中で見つけたら、\nニホに帝都に戻るように伝えておいてくれる？\n連絡がつかなくなって、心配だから――それじゃ、よろしくね。",
      "jp_sha256": "7545cf924a8041080379e3b85b08c79cdce2fdf7385b8d8f7171fd5770b45cdf",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그리고 가는 길에 발견하면\n니호에게 제도로 돌아오라고 전해줄래?\n연락이 끊겨서 걱정이니까――그럼 잘 부탁해.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "c7c2f7c4c79ca417365a9fff226cccaec72608012b3a432cdefdf04a26d935f1:000002_8672277162074768752:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カティナ",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "あと、道中で見つけたら、\nニホに帝都に戻るように伝えておいてくれる？\n連絡がつかなくなって、心配だから――それじゃ、よろしくね。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カティナ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "428282a45fff4531658b356e3d39a57baacd31a0a3f193d7259cd26c518927a0",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "連絡事項だけを簡素に告げると、「早く行け」と言わんばかりに、\nカティナは地図と魔法石を主人公に押しつけた。",
      "jp_sha256": "d97a51015f5eb3afec8aa10c50b4021717512a582b084f42ff88dbe4aef2ca6e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "연락 사항만 간단히 전하자 「빨리 가」라고 말하는 듯\n카티나는 지도와 마법석을 주인공에게 떠밀었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 22,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "c7c2f7c4c79ca417365a9fff226cccaec72608012b3a432cdefdf04a26d935f1:000002_8672277162074768752:g0:r21",
      "row_index_0based": 21,
      "serialized_row_index": 21,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "連絡事項だけを簡素に告げると、「早く行け」と言わんばかりに、\nカティナは地図と魔法石を主人公に押しつけた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8fa2c133dedeec6dfa71931796792883109bac3a92a39444842e1a4c75e05c5e",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
